<title>USA: Providian Corp Q3 shr rises to $1.13.</title>
<headline>Providian Corp Q3 shr rises to $1.13.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.13		    $0.93</p>
<p> Net			106,170		   88,789</p>
<p> Revs		     891,950		  857,317</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
